25</strong><strong></strong></p><p>This bill (1) expands guaranteed issue rights with respect to Medigap policies (Medicare supplemental health insurance policies), (2) eliminates certain limitations&nbsp;on Medigap policies for newly eligible Medicare beneficiaries, and (3) modifies other provisions related to Medigap policies. (Guaranteed issue rights require that a policy be offered to any eligible applicant without regard to health status.)</p>","updateDate":"2025-03-10T16:46:42Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Close the Medigap Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-15T08:06:20Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-15T08:06:20Z"}
